{"title": "Mushroom Circle", "pageid": 28150, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mushroom_Circle", "categories": ["Environmental objects", "Mushrooms"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png/300px-Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png/450px-Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png/600px-Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png/300px-Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"201\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Mushroom_circle_unpowered.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>A mushroom circle in the Underdark, unpowered.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Mushroom Circle</b> is a magical transportation device.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>An unassuming ring of mushrooms at first glance, when suffused with the power of fey energies it allows characters to teleport between two points at will. Traversing a Mushroom Circle for the first time awards <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/24px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/36px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/48px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/24px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Inspiration\" title=\"Inspiration\">Walking on Air</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">outlanders</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Powered_mushroom_circle.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Powered_mushroom_circle.png/300px-Powered_mushroom_circle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Powered_mushroom_circle.png/450px-Powered_mushroom_circle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Powered_mushroom_circle.png/600px-Powered_mushroom_circle.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Powered_mushroom_circle.png/300px-Powered_mushroom_circle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Powered_mushroom_circle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>A Mushroom Circle in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>, powered.</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;72&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-274</span> leads to <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;45&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-265</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;45&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-265</span> leads to <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;72&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-274</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;98&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-283</span> leads to Overgrown Tunnel <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-359&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;599</span> if discovered, otherwise Sunlit Wetlands <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-74&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;210</span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sunlit_Wetlands\" title=\"Sunlit Wetlands\">Sunlit Wetlands</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-74&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;210</span> leads to Overgrown Tunnel <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-413&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;614</span> if discovered, otherwise Underdark <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;98&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-283</span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Tunnel\" title=\"Overgrown Tunnel\">Overgrown Tunnel</a> below <a href=\"/wiki/Riverside_Teahouse\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riverside Teahouse\">Riverside Teahouse</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-359&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;599</span> leads to Underdark <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;98&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-283</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-413&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;614</span> leads to Sunlit Wetlands <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-74&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;210</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200102\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 135/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 970/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.372      1 -total\n 70.84%    0.972     14 Template:Coords\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28150-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200102 and revision id 278472. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}